    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "Tachometer"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "ON-VEHICLE INSPECTION OF TACHOMETER"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "(a) Connect a tune-up test tachometer and start the engine.",
        "(b) Compare the tester and tachometer indications. If the error is excessive, replace the tachometer."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "caution",
      "text": "CAUTION:\n• Reversing the connection of the tachometer will damage the transistors and diodes inside.\n• When removing or installing the tachometer, be careful not to drop or subject it to severe shock."
    },
