      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "INSPECTION OF VOLTMETER"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Compare the tester and voltmeter indications."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "If the error is excessive, replace the voltmeter."
